# UI tooltips

When the user asks for a tooltip (or hover tip / help text on hover), use **our** immediate tooltip — not the browser's native `title` tooltip.

## Do

- Prefer `has-icon-tip` on the host + `<span className="icon-tip" role="tooltip">…</span>` for short tips.
- Use `level-card-tip` only where that richer pattern already applies (Engine level cards).
- Tips should appear immediately on hover / focus-visible (see `.icon-tip` in `src/index.css`).

## Don't

- Do **not** use `title=` / native browser tooltips for hover help (delayed, inconsistent look).
- Do not invent a third tooltip system without an explicit request.

## References

- CSS: `src/index.css` — “Immediate hover tips (engine-style; no native title delay).”
- Examples: `StationListToolbar` fold toggle, `ComponentTreeRow` randomise / fold-all, `ModsTable` `TipCell`.
